    "sections": {
        "description": "Venesia Lite is a versatile WordPress theme designed for writers, bloggers, photographers and online shops. Its homepage slideshow helps you highlight featured posts with strong visual impact, while customizable background options allow you to personalize the look of your site. With support for Contact Form 7 and WooCommerce, Venesia Lite is suitable for both content-focused websites and online stores. Its responsive design ensures a smooth browsing experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices."
